title Cassette playing at 480x800 (its own density) with Monitor on: MON drawn but dark
sizes 480x800
env CASSETTE_DEMO playing
env CASSETTE_DEMO_MONITOR on
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot mon-lamp-playing-tall
expect text "MON"
expect text "PLAY"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
